@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Audit summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/summary

### Seed demo audit events
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/seed-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### List audit events
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit?limit=20

### List audit failures
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit?status=failure&limit=20

### List notification audit events
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit?entityType=notification_channel&limit=20

### Create audit event
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "manual.audit.test",
  "summary": "Manual audit event from REST Client",
  "severity": "info",
  "status": "success",
  "actor": {
    "type": "api",
    "id": "rest-client",
    "name": "VS Code REST Client"
  },
  "entity": {
    "type": "system",
    "id": "audit",
    "name": "Audit Log Engine"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "manual": true
  }
}

### Get audit by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit/audit_xxx
